4. The group executed a real estate project at Jakson Gate, Agartala in the year 2010 under Joint Operations with Agartala Municipal Council (AMC). As the group was unable to sell the constructed area, the substantial portion of the constructed area has been let-out to various Government Organizations. The group is exploring the possibilities to sell the same in consultation with JV partner. The group has incurred a sum of Rs. 916.96 lakhs as on date. JV partner (AMC) is yet to issue OC/CC certificate post which RERA formalties will be done and sales will be opened/ launched. &lt;BR&gt; 
